--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2] model_tflite.cpp — TFLite Model Data ("hi realtek" wake word)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The embedded TFLite model binary (src/tinyml_main/model_tflite.cpp) is a
streaming wake-word detector for the phrase "hi realtek". The trained model
weights are a Realtek work product provided under the Realtek license above.
No third-party code is redistributed with the model.
